meta {
  name: add stock
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}inventory/stock/add/
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    // Component id. Required. Archived components can't receive stock.
    "component": 1,

    // Chamber location code. Required.
    "location": "A11",

    // Quantity in the component's unit, > 0, up to 3 decimals if the unit allows. Required.
    "quantity": "40",

    // Optional, BDT. Overwrite the component's last_buying_price / delivery_charge.
    "unit_price": "450.00",
    "delivery_charge": "150.00",

    // Optional.
    "note": "Initial purchase"
  }
}

docs {
  ## API explanation
  Puts new stock into a chamber (FR-6.4). Admin or Manager. The chamber must
  be empty or already hold this component. When `unit_price` /
  `delivery_charge` are given they overwrite the component's last buying price
  and delivery charge.

  Rules shared by every stock operation (FR-6):
  - Locations are chamber codes such as `A11` (case-insensitive).
  - A chamber holds one component type (FR-6.2).
  - Quantities must be greater than zero and whole numbers for units that don't allow fractions.
  - Each operation writes an immutable movement (FR-6.5) and runs with row locks, so concurrent operations can't drive a chamber below zero (FR-6.11).
  - The response has the `movement` and the resulting `stock_entries`.

  ## API example response
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Stock added.",
    "movement": {
      "id": 1,
      "movement_type": "ADD",
      "movement_type_display": "Add",
      "component": {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "DC Gear Motor 12V",
        "part_number": "JGB37-520",
        "unit_symbol": "pcs"
      },
      "source_location": null,
      "destination_location": "A11",
      "quantity": "40.000",
      "quantity_before": null,
      "quantity_after": null,
      "unit_price": "450.00",
      "delivery_charge": "150.00",
      "performed_by": {
        "id": 2,
        "username": "karim.hossain",
        "email": "karim.hossain@example.com",
        "role": "MANAGER"
      },
      "project": null,
      "related_movement": null,
      "note": "Initial purchase",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T22:17:36.594539+06:00"
    },
    "stock_entries": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "location": "A11",
        "chamber": 1,
        "component": {
          "id": 1,
          "name": "DC Gear Motor 12V",
          "part_number": "JGB37-520",
          "unit_symbol": "pcs"
        },
        "quantity": "40.000",
        "note": "",
        "created_at": "2026-09-14T22:17:36.591057+06:00",
        "updated_at": "2026-09-14T22:17:36.591063+06:00"
      }
    ]
  }

  Chamber holds a different component (400):
  {
    "success": false,
    "message": "Location A11 already holds DC Gear Motor 12V. A chamber can only hold one component type."
  }

  As Staff (403):
  {
    "success": false,
    "message": "Only Admins and Managers can perform this action."
  }
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
}
